53.description:
Energy costs are skyrocketing because Republicans are suppressing clean energy. Home insurance premiums are ballooning because Republicans ignore climate risks.

And Trump continues to call climate change a hoax while ceding global leadership on climate.

@SenatorWhitehouse, @RepJeffries, and @NancyPelosi sound the alarm on the Trump Administration’s abandonment of climate action and undermining of U.S. participation at COP30.

